    "report_markdown": "# Hypora run report: run_656802fce600\n\n**Outcome:** a verified model.\n\n## Task\n- Objective: Predict whether a credit applicant is a good or a bad customer.\n- Target: `good_or_bad_customer` (binary_classification)\n- Primary metric: `roc_auc` (maximize)\n\n## Summary\nWe were asked to predict whether a credit applicant is a good or a bad customer. We tried multiple models including a logistic regression baseline, a random forest classifier, and a gradient boosting classifier. The random forest classifier was selected as the final model, delivering a test ROC AUC score of 0.7672.\n\n**Observations**\n- The random forest candidate achieved a mean validation ROC AUC of 0.7927.\n- The baseline logistic regression trial achieved a mean validation ROC AUC of 0.7927.\n- No leakage candidates were flagged during the feature screen, though this does not prove leakage is completely absent.\n\n**Limitations**\n- The screening process did not exhaustively prove the total absence of data leakage.\n- Performance metrics are bound to the specific feature set and data distribution provided in this run.\n\n_Written by the Reporter; every number above is filled in from stored metrics._\n\n## Final model\n- Trial `trl_71f76cfd`: RandomForestClassifier with tuned depth and n_estimators will achieve strong ROC AUC on tabular credit data\n- Verified: yes\n\n| Metric | Test (once) | Validation (mean) |\n|---|---|---|\n| roc_auc | 0.7672 | 0.7927 |\n| accuracy | 0.7533 | 0.7467 |\n| balanced_accuracy | 0.6333 | 0.6254 |\n| precision | 0.7656 | 0.7619 |\n| recall | 0.9333 | 0.9286 |\n| f1 | 0.8412 | 0.8369 |\n| precision_macro | 0.7237 | 0.7108 |\n| recall_macro | 0.6333 | 0.6254 |\n| f1_macro | 0.6445 | 0.6343 |\n| pr_auc | 0.8657 | 0.9002 |\n| log_loss | 0.5188 | 0.4986 |\n| brier_score | 0.1701 | 0.1658 |\n\n| Check | Status | Detail |\n|---|---|---|\n| allowed_features | passed | trial code received exactly the contract's allowed features |\n| split_respected | passed | stratified split: disjoint, complete |\n| test_labels_not_accessed | passed | every predict stage saw features and the model only |\n| output_shape | passed | one prediction per planned row, task-shaped columns |\n| finite_outputs | passed | all predictions finite and well-formed |\n| metric_recomputation | passed | recomputed metrics match the harness |\n| artifact_loads | passed | the frozen model loaded in a sandbox and predicted the test split |\n| resource_limits | passed | every stage completed inside the submitted job's limits |\n| learned_transform_leakage | skipped | static analysis of fit/predict arrives with verifier v2 (S3.C4) |\n\n## Trials\n| Trial | Kind | Status | Validation roc_auc (mean \u00b1 std, folds) | Hypothesis |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| `trl_0825128f` | baseline | validated | 0.7732 \u00b1 0.0286 (3) | Logistic regression with standard preprocessing provides a solid baseline for binary classification |\n| `trl_71f76cfd` | candidate | verified | 0.7927 \u00b1 0.0192 (3) | RandomForestClassifier with tuned depth and n_estimators will achieve strong ROC AUC on tabular credit data |\n| `trl_f614b965` | candidate | validated | 0.7556 \u00b1 0.0073 (3) | HistGradientBoostingClassifier will achieve higher ROC AUC than logistic regression on tabular credit data |\n\n## Data\n- Split: stratified, 20% test, stratified_kfold_3\n- Features used: 20; excluded: none\n- Leakage screen: No leakage candidates flagged among 20 screened features; this does not prove that leakage is absent.\n\n## Decision and faults\n- Decision: train (approved_plan)\n- Fault TOOL_UNAVAILABLE at submit_experiment: recovered\n- Fault PIPELINE_SYNTAX_ERROR at write_trial_files: recovered\n\n## Run notes\n- Stage-1 placeholder (D-019): contract built by code, plan approved by policy; replaced by the Data Lead (S3.A2) and the plan gate (S3.D2).\n- The agent finished after 17 model turns, 15 tool calls; it nominated trl_71f76cfd.\n- Final candidate trl_71f76cfd: nominated by the agent.\n- Final job job_1794150940190654978_0bc2de: test split scored once; verifier v1 passed.\n\n## Sources\n- `task_spec:run_656802fce600.v1`\n- `profile:run_656802fce600.profile.af9994e073a8`\n- `experiment_contract:run_656802fce600.v1`\n- `result:trl_71f76cfd/test`\n"
